# Windows / PowerShell conventions

- Prefer **PowerShell-safe** command chaining in docs and suggestions.
  - ✅ Use `;` or separate commands (new lines)
  - ❌ Avoid `&&` / `||` (can fail depending on PS version/environment)
- When suggesting curl, prefer `curl.exe` (PowerShell aliases `curl` to `Invoke-WebRequest`).
- Use Windows paths when referring to local files (e.g. `D:\Work\...`) unless the repo is clearly cross-platform.

